# The trust root of the copy-truth checks (decision 0114): every file, and every .cairn.yml job, that decides how a pull
# request is judged. scripts/check-copy-vs-marketplace.py --mode trust-root hashes each entry into
# config/trust-root.sha256, and CINC web-copy-truth-08 fails, naming the entry, when the two differ. A PR that changes
# an entry therefore also changes config/trust-root.sha256, in plain sight, for review/security.
# Entries: a file, a directory/** (every file under it), or .cairn.yml#<job>. This file is always an entry itself.
scripts/check-copy-vs-marketplace.py
scripts/render/**
cinc/profiles/stigready-web/controls/copy_truth.rb
cinc/profiles/stigready-web/files/copy-truth/**
config/snapshot-signers
.cairn.yml#copy-truth
.cairn.yml#copy-drift-watch
